>> list := Lethathamo ncha.
list ~ ['hello'].
Sephetho ngola: list palo-ea-lintho.
list eketsa-qetellong: ['world'].
Sephetho ngola: list palo-ea-lintho.
Sephetho ngola: list ntsha-ea-ho-qetela, ngola: list palo-ea-lintho.
list eketsa-qetellong: ['there'].
Sephetho ngola: list palo-ea-lintho.
Sephetho ngola: (list boemo: 0), ngola: (list boemo: 1).
list beha: ['xmas'] sebakeng: 1.
list beha: ['merry'] sebakeng: 0.
Sephetho ngola: list palo-ea-lintho.
Sephetho ngola: (list boemo: 0), ngola: (list boemo: 1).
